<title>NORWAY: Dyno strengthens position in Asia Pacific.</title>
<headline>Dyno strengthens position in Asia Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian chemicals company Dyno Industrier ASA said on Monday it had bought the remaining 50 percent shareholding in explosives manufacturing and marketing company Dyno Wesfarmers Ltd (DWL) from Wesfarmers Ltd of Australia.</p>
<p>Dyno said the deal included Wesfarmers' interest in Dyno Wesfarmers Hong Kong (DWHK) and Thai Nitrate Co (TNC).</p>
